            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a laundry treating apparatus (1000) comprising a pressure vessel (200) configured for accommodating carbon dioxide therein, a storage tank (150) configured for storing carbon dioxide therein to supply carbon dioxide to the pressure vessel, a distillation tank (401) configured for storing carbon dioxide discharged from the pressure vessel (200) to remove foreign substances dissolved in carbon dioxide discharged from the pressure vessel (200), a gas supply pipe (690) configured for connecting the distillation tank (401) and the pressure vessel (200) to each other to supply gaseous carbon dioxide stored in the distillation tank (401) to the pressure vessel (200), a first supply pipe (621) configured for connecting a top of the storage tank (150) to the pressure vessel (200). And a second supply pipe (622) connected to a bottom of the storage tank (150) and the pressure vessel (200) to supply liquid carbon dioxide stored in the storage tank (150) to the pressure vessel (200). Wherein when the storage tank (150) and the pressure vessel (200) reach an equilibrium pressure, liquid carbon dioxide stored in the storage tank (150) is transferred to the pressure vessel (200) through the second supply pipe (622) by gravity.</p>
